      "predicate": "uses",
      "object": "bilingual parallel sentences",
      "object_type": "Dataset",
      "source_sentence": "The state-of-the-art data selection approaches search for bilingual parallel sentences using the difference in language model perplexity between two language models trained on in-domain."
